I audited only [review-core-v60.txt](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-noise/review-core-v60.txt) against version 4 of the [extraction standard](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:356). I did not assess questions, fields or matching. As requested, I do not count the loss of §6’s optional items as a breach.

