| “Read each evidence item back as the analyst following the company and keep it when you would write it in this week's notes because it makes some question's answer more or less likely” | §5.1: “一个在追这家公司的分析员，读到会在本周笔记里写下来，因为它让某个问题的答案更可能或更不可能。” | **CONSISTENT.** This carries the standard’s central test. |
| “about the company or its customers, suppliers, competitors, regulators or the economy.” | §5.1: “问题不限于库里已有的，也不限于本公司：客户、供应商、竞争者、监管、宏观都算” | **CONSISTENT.** The scope matches this line, though §5.1’s four kinds also explicitly mention partners. |
