| “the leading soft-drink brand has held 40% of its market for years”, in an article about a bank | §5.1: “作者说‘英特尔多年领先，占 CPU 市场 59%’，和英伟达的问题关系不大，分析员不会记。” | **CONSISTENT.** The principle follows the page’s irrelevant longstanding-figure example, but the soft-drink figure and bank scenario are **invented**, not examples from the page; the scenario is bank-specific, even though the irrelevance principle is general. |
